  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000qx8k](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000qx8k) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Aug 01 2025 96 km ESE of Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 52.8679 longitude 160.0266. It impacted 45 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
